msgid "Durabix - EU Legal Guarantee Notice for WooCommerce requires WooCommerce to be active."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:44
msgid "Green Claims Phrase Check"
msgstr ""

#. translators: 1: number of variations checked, 2: number of variations the product has
#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:65
#, php-format
msgid "Only the first %1$d of %2$d variations were checked."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:71
msgid "None of the checked phrases found. This check looks for a short list of phrases only and does not assess other environmental claims."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:77
msgid "Phrases to review:"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:86
msgid "A match is not a breach in itself. Point 4a does not apply when you can show recognised excellent environmental performance relevant to the claim, or when the claim is specified in clear and prominent terms on the same medium, such as the online selling interface (recital 9 of Directive (EU) 2024/825). Point 4c covers climate claims based on offsetting."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:95
msgid "EU harmonised notice and GARAN label (Article 6(1)(l) and (la) of Directive 2011/83/EU)"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:99
msgid "Hide the notice (not a good)"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:100
msgid "Hide the harmonised notice for this product, for example a digital download or a service: the notice covers goods. Article 6(1)(lb) of Directive 2011/83/EU requires a separate reminder for digital content and digital services, which Durabix does not show."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:105
#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:176
msgid "Commercial Durability (Years)"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:106
msgid "Only if the producer offers a commercial guarantee of durability at no extra cost for more than 2 years (e.g. 3, 5, 10). Values of 2 or less are not saved."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:114
#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:177
msgid "Producer / Brand Name"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:115
msgid "Name of the producer offering the commercial guarantee of durability, as printed on the GARAN label. The label shows only when this and the years are filled in. Up to 40 characters."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:122
#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:178
msgid "Model identifier"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:123
msgid "Model identifier for which the producer offers the guarantee, as printed on the GARAN label. Empty uses the SKU. Up to 40 characters."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:130
msgid "Repairability Class (A - E)"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:131
msgid "Repairability class from the energy label of a smartphone or slate tablet under Delegated Regulation (EU) 2023/1669, from 20 June 2025. Article 1 excludes phones and tablets with a main display the user can roll up or unroll, and smartphones for high security communication. Leave it empty for every other product. Durabix shows the class as a badge, not in the official label format."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:134
msgid "None"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:168
msgid "Same as the parent product"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:175
msgid "GARAN label of this variation"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:32
msgid "Durabix EU Guarantees"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:33
msgid "EU Legal Guarantee"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:79
msgid "Durabix - EU Legal Guarantee & Durability Notices"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:81
msgid "The harmonised notice on the legal guarantee of conformity and the GARAN label for a producer guarantee of durability, as required by Article 6(1)(l) and (la) of Directive 2011/83/EU from 27 September 2026, in the official design of Implementing Regulation (EU) 2025/1960, plus a green claims phrase check (Annex I, points 4a and 4c, of Directive 2005/29/EC). The notice follows the site language."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:88
msgid "Enable the notice and label"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:92
msgid "Display the harmonised notice, the GARAN label and the repairability class on product pages"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:97
msgid "Display Location"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:101
msgid "Under single product summary (near add to cart)"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:105
msgid "In a dedicated product tab (\"Guarantee & Durability\")"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:110
msgid "Checkout"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:114
msgid "Show the notice above the place order button, classic and block checkout"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:119
msgid "Order confirmation email"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:123
msgid "Add the notice and the GARAN labels (as attached files) to the processing and on-hold order emails sent to the customer"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:128
msgid "Every page"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:132
msgid "Show the notice at the foot of every page of the site, as a general reminder"
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: the shortcode
#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:137
#, php-format
msgid "To place it yourself, for example on your terms page, use the %s shortcode."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:143
msgid "National note"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:146
msgid "Optional plain text shown under the notice and in the order email. The EU notice cannot be edited and states the two-year EU minimum; if your country gives consumers a longer legal guarantee, say so here in your own words. Durabix does not fill this in for you."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:169
msgid "Durabix is switched off, so the legal guarantee notice is shown nowhere: not on product pages, at checkout or in order emails."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:171
msgid "Settings"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:185
msgid "Complementary integration: Shoplex - EU Compliance for WooCommerce"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:187
msgid "Shoplex adds other EU consumer law modules, such as the Omnibus lowest price and checkout disclosures."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:192
msgid "Shoplex is active."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:197
msgid "Explore Shoplex EU Compliance"
msgstr ""

#: src/Model/GreenClaimsRules.php:27
msgid "Banned when the neutral, reduced or positive greenhouse gas impact is based on offsetting emissions. Point 4c does not cover a claim based on the product's actual lifecycle impact (recital 12 of Directive (EU) 2024/825)."
msgstr ""

#: src/Model/GreenClaimsRules.php:33
msgid "A generic environmental claim is banned unless you can show recognised excellent environmental performance relevant to it, or the claim is specified in clear and prominent terms on the same medium (recital 9 of Directive (EU) 2024/825)."
msgstr ""

#: src/Model/GreenClaimsRules.php:39
msgid "A generic biodegradability claim is banned unless you can show recognised excellent environmental performance relevant to it, or the claim is specified in clear and prominent terms on the same medium (recital 9 of Directive (EU) 2024/825)."
msgstr ""

#: src/Model/GreenClaimsRules.php:45
msgid "Banned when the claim is based on offsetting emissions. Point 4c does not cover a claim based on the product's actual lifecycle impact (recital 12 of Directive (EU) 2024/825)."
msgstr ""

